<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan to issue T$8 bln NCDs on Monday.</title>
<headline>Taiwan to issue T$8 bln NCDs on Monday.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's central bank will issue T$8 billion in three-month negotiable certificates of deposits (NCDs) this afternoon, a central bank official said on Monday.</p>
<p>Bids will close at 1500 p.m. (0700 gmt), the official said.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
